ViridianCity_School_6F_Text_Placard::
    .string "6F  BIAS\p"
    .string "The ways a mind leans, and the\n"
    .string "arguments that only look sound.\p"
    .string "The syllabus is on the desk.$"

ViridianCity_School_6F_Text_Syllabus::
    .string "COURSE SYLLABUS\n"
    .string "6F  BIAS\p"
    .string "TOPICS: FRAMING, ANCHORS,\n"
    .string "CONFIRMING, HINDSIGHT, FALLACIES.\p"
    .string "All of it is on the board.\n"
    .string "The exam covers the board.\p"
    .string "PASS MARK: 80 out of 100.$"

ViridianCity_School_6F_Text_Framing::
    .string "FRAMING\p"
    .string "Ninety in a hundred survive.\n"
    .string "Ten in a hundred die.\p"
    .string "It is the same number. People\n"
    .string "choose differently between them.\p"
    .string "The way a thing is put is doing\n"
    .string "the choosing.$"

ViridianCity_School_6F_Text_Anchors::
    .string "ANCHORS\p"
    .string "The first number heard pulls every\n"
    .string "guess after it toward itself.\p"
    .string "Even when everyone knows it was\n"
    .string "picked at random.$"

ViridianCity_School_6F_Text_Confirming::
    .string "CONFIRMING\p"
    .string "People look for what agrees with\n"
    .string "them, and find it.\p"
    .string "What disagrees gets checked twice\n"
    .string "as hard.$"

ViridianCity_School_6F_Text_Hindsight::
    .string "HINDSIGHT\p"
    .string "Once you know how it ended, it\n"
    .string "looks as if it had to end that way.\p"
    .string "It did not.$"

ViridianCity_School_6F_Text_Fallacies::
    .string "FALLACIES\p"
    .string "A fallacy is an argument that\n"
    .string "looks as if it works.\p"
    .string "Attacking the speaker. Two choices\n"
    .string "where there are more.\p"
    .string "Everybody does it, so it is fine.$"

ViridianCity_School_6F_Text_Teacher::
    .string "BIAS.\p"
    .string "Everyone in this room has read\n"
    .string "the board.\p"
    .string "Each of them has found that it\n"
    .string "describes somebody else.$"

ViridianCity_School_6F_Text_Wrongabout::
    .string "He only disagrees with me because\n"
    .string "he is wrong about everything.\p"
    .string "That is not a fallacy. That is\n"
    .string "just true.$"

ViridianCity_School_6F_Text_Twooptions::
    .string "Either you agree with me, or you\n"
    .string "have not read the board.\p"
    .string "Those are the only two options.$"
